{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\Ia\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-tools-in-root",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "phpunit/phpunit is in require-dev of composer.json. The manual recommends a vendor-bin/ of bamarni/composer-bin-plugin per tool, so that the dependencies of a tool cannot conflict with those of the app."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ocp-deprecated",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Flow/ReviewOperation.php:118 OCP\\SystemTag\\MapperEvent::EVENT_ASSIGN: deprecated since Nextcloud 22",
        "lib/Flow/ReviewOperation.php:122 OCP\\EventDispatcher\\GenericEvent: deprecated since Nextcloud 22; use \\OCP\\EventDispatcher\\Event"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "2 uses in 1 file of the public API that is deprecated in Nextcloud 34. The text of the tag names the replacement where it has one.",
        "  lib/Flow/ReviewOperation.php:118 OCP\\SystemTag\\MapperEvent::EVENT_ASSIGN: deprecated since Nextcloud 22",
        "  lib/Flow/ReviewOperation.php:122 OCP\\EventDispatcher\\GenericEvent: deprecated since Nextcloud 22; use \\OCP\\EventDispatcher\\Event"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "job-time-sensitivity",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/BackgroundJob/ReadingSweepJob.php OCA\\Ia\\BackgroundJob\\ReadingSweepJob",
        "lib/BackgroundJob/RunJob.php OCA\\Ia\\BackgroundJob\\RunJob"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "2 timed jobs do not say whether they are time sensitive. A job that sets TIME_INSENSITIVE with setTimeSensitivity() is moved to the maintenance window of the server; whether a job is heavy enough for that only its maintainer knows.",
        "  lib/BackgroundJob/ReadingSweepJob.php OCA\\Ia\\BackgroundJob\\ReadingSweepJob",
        "  lib/BackgroundJob/RunJob.php OCA\\Ia\\BackgroundJob\\RunJob"
      ]
    },
